{"ati": [{"id": "ati", "headword": "अति", "headword_slp1": "ati", "fold": "ati", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "benfey", "senses": [{"gloss": "अति अति.\n I. adv. Over, exceedingly in a high degree, much. Comparat. अति + तराम्, very much, Vedāntas. in Chr. 217 10.\n II. prepos. with the acc. Over beyond, more than.\n III. Combined and compounded with verbs and their derivatives.\n IV. Former part of compound nouns and adverbs, implying\n 1. Exceedingly, much, very: e. g. अति-गुरु, adj. very heavy; अति-काय, adj. having a very large body, gigantic\n 2. Too muc: e. g. अति-प्रणय, n. exorbitant love, Daśak. in Chr. 18, 10; अत्यश्नन्त्, i. e. अति- (vb. 2. अश्), adj. eating too much.\n 3. Surpassing the object denoted by the following part the comp. These comps. are generally: a) adj. e. g. अतीन्द्रिय, i. e. अति-, surpassing the senses, transcendental. b) adv., e. g. अति-मात्र + म् exceeding extraordinarily.\n --Cf. ἔτι; Lat. at in atavus, and et.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "atikrama": [{"id": "atikrama", "headword": "अतिक्रम", "headword_slp1": "atikrama", "fold": "atikrama", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "benfey", "senses": [{"gloss": "अतिक्रम अति-क्रम् + अ, m. Transgression (of time), Pañc. 55, 5.\n 2. Violation, Man. 11, 120. Offence.\n 4. Irreverence, Man. 3, 63. []\n --Comp.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["अतिक्रमः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["atikramaH"]}], "atikramaRa": [{"id": "atikramaRa", "headword": "अतिक्रमण", "headword_slp1": "atikramaRa", "fold": "atikramaRa", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "benfey", "senses": [{"gloss": "अतिक्रमण अतिक्रमण, i. e. अति-क्रम् + अन, n.\n 1. Overstepping (of a boundary), Yājñ. 2, 155.\n 2. Transgression (of time), Pañc. i. d. 170.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["अतिक्रमणं"], "synonyms_slp1": ["atikramaRaM"]}], "atikramin": [{"id": "atikramin", "headword": "अतिक्रमिन्", "headword_slp1": "atikramin", "fold": "atikramin", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "benfey", "senses": [{"gloss": "अतिक्रमिन